<title>UK: Bag with $1.5 million stolen from BA plane.</title>
<headline>Bag with $1.5 million stolen from BA plane.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bag containing $1.5 million in cash was stolen from a British Airways plane last week, British police said.</p>
<p>They said the bag was one of 15 belonging to an international bank which were being transported on board a flight from Heathrow to Zurich. It was discovered missing by cargo security on arrival in Switzerland.</p>
<p>Police said they believe the bag was stolen on October 24.</p>
<p>British Airways officials were not available for comment.</p>
</text>
